+# Wire Format
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on the wire serialisation format. A prior decision was revoked (commit 3a54ada touched `config/decisions/revoke-wire-format.json`), and unlike other revoked-and-replaced decisions in this project's history, no follow-up record establishes a resulting value, so no format is currently designated.
